      "context": "concept — /main/preferences#notifications — One switch, three exclusive modes: Off (nothing anywhere, no badge, inbox empty), In the app (toasts only while Bitrate is open; default), Always (system notifications only, open or closed, no in-app duplicates). Choosing Always explains it first, then asks the system for permission; if the system blocks it, the previous mode stays."
